// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// The Statistics Event recurs periodically to create a Time basis for a legacy Timekeeping model.
// When the Event operates, it KNOWS a period of Time has occured, because Agency has been granted.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// The Statistics Event:
//
//  1) Calculates the value using current information "about the Event": the number of times Agency
//      was granted by ssTEA, changes from Paused to Agencying, changes from Agencying to Paused.
//  2) The difference between these values and the values saved from the last Time the Event did
//      the calculations shows the number of Agency changes by the Event within a Period of Time.
